  },
  "ConcurrencyControl": "etag",
  "ConcurrencyControlNote": "Microsoft Graph uses ETag / @odata.etag on resources that support it (DriveItems, ListItems). Clients may send If-Match headers on PATCH/DELETE to enforce optimistic concurrency. On a conflict the API returns HTTP 412 Precondition Failed. Source: OData protocol used by Graph; Graph DriveItem documentation notes ETag support on file items.",
  "DeleteSemantics": "soft",
