  "DefaultConflictResolution": "MostRecent",
  "DefaultConflictResolutionReasoning": "ETag / @odata.etag is available on DriveItems and supports optimistic concurrency. When etag concurrency control is enabled, MostRecent conflict resolution is viable. For resources without etag support, fall back to DestWins.",
